        "name": "The Gold Is A Fill Rule",
        "body": "Gold is a fill with ink on it. As text it appears only on indigo (the heading accent phrase, the closing phone link hover, footer link hover); on paper the same phrase uses gold-ink.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Indigos Rule",
        "body": "A dark band is either logo indigo (plain) or night indigo (with the line texture). No third dark, and never black.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Faint Lines Rule",
        "body": "The deep-band texture is `repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0 22px, line-texture 22px 23px)` and stays at 3.5% white so it never reads as lines through text.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tappable Is Display Rule",
        "body": "Anything you can press is set in Cal Sans; running text never is.",
